---
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
---
<ToolLayout title="Kubernetes Resource Calculator" description="Converta medições observadas em um ponto de partida para requests e limits."><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="text-sm font-semibold">CPU p95 (millicores)<input id="cpu" type="number" min="1" value="250" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-transparent px-4 py-3 dark:border-slate-700" /></label><label class="text-sm font-semibold">Memória p95 (MiB)<input id="memory" type="number" min="1" value="384" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-transparent px-4 py-3 dark:border-slate-700" /></label></div><button id="resources" class="mt-5 rounded-lg bg-sky-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Gerar sugestão</button><pre id="manifest" class="mt-7 overflow-auto rounded-lg bg-slate-950 p-5 text-sm text-slate-200" aria-live="polite"></pre><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Estimativa inicial: request = p95; limit de memória = 1,5×. Valide com telemetria real e comportamento sob throttling/OOM.</p><script>
const run=()=>{const cpu=Number(document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#cpu')!.value);const memory=Number(document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#memory')!.value);document.querySelector('#manifest')!.textContent=cpu>0&&memory>0?`resources:\n  requests:\n    cpu: "${Math.ceil(cpu)}m"\n    memory: "${Math.ceil(memory)}Mi"\n  limits:\n    memory: "${Math.ceil(memory*1.5)}Mi"`:'Informe medições maiores que zero.';};document.querySelector('#resources')?.addEventListener('click',run);run();
</script></ToolLayout>
